Module 1.7 — Java Keywords & Modifiers

Complete Mastery Question Bank

Yes — for 1.7 I’ll follow exactly the pattern you specified for 1.4 and 1.6:

> Basic → Intermediate → Advanced → Traps → Design → Debugging Challenges → Production



And I’ll apply that structure to every modifier/subtopic, rather than grouping all interview questions separately.

Your Module 1.7 covers access control, final, static, abstract, default, synchronized, volatile, transient, native, strictfp, sealed types, modifier interactions, JMM implications and production decisions. 


---

